<title>USA: Matria Healthcare Q3 shr loss widens.</title>
<headline>Matria Healthcare Q3 shr loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>MARIETTA, Ga. 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr	loss	    $0.20     loss	 $0.06</p>
<p> Net	loss	    7,344     loss	   995</p>
<p> Revs			36,594		   21,062</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  36,044		   17,406</p>
<p>	  Nine months</p>
<p> Shr	loss	    $1.19     loss	 $0.56</p>
<p> Net	loss	   37,001     loss	 9,667</p>
<p> Revs			96,933		   66,993</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  31,018		   17,343</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: 1996 Q3 net income includes merger related amortization of goodwill and other intangibles of $9.3 million or $0.26 per share. Earnings excluding these amounts was $0.05 per share for the third quarter and a $0.03 per share loss for the nine months. Full company name is Matria Healthcare Inc.</p>
